  "notes": "Issued on custom 'X-ray Spex' blue labels in either a high gloss fully laminated cover or a semi-glossy non-laminated one. With cardstock inner sleeve with rounded corners, illustrated and with lyrics printed in brown.\n\nAlbum title front cover: Germfree Adolescents.\nAlbum title labels: Germ Free Adolescents.\n\nTrack B4 back cover and insert: Germ Free Adolescents.\nTrack B4 label: Germ Free Adolesence.\n\nTrack B3 cover and insert: I Am A Poseur\nTrack B3 label: Iama Poseur.\n \n\nOn rear cover:\nArt-I-Ficial Products. \nEMI Records Ltd. Hayes, Middlesex, England. \nMade and Printed in Great Britain. \nAvailable on Tape.\nE.D.T. G.L.\n\nMatrix/Runouts: 'Mastered at 'Abbey Road' - Nick' and 'Nick UU' are etched, everything else stamped.",
  "released_formatted": "10 Nov 1978",
